sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI (routes.tsx)
    participant Nginx as Nginx Proxy
    participant Backend as Python API (user_api / document_api / chat_api)
    participant Service as DB Service Layer
    participant DB as MySQL DB

    UI->>Nginx: HTTP Request (Headers: Authorization / Cookie)
    Nginx->>Backend: Forward to Quart/Gin Backend
    Backend->>Backend: Validate Request & Auth Context
    Backend->>Service: Invoke Service Method
    Service->>DB: Execute SQL Query / Transaction
    DB-->>Service: Database Result / Rows
    Service-->>Backend: Return Domain Entity Data
    Backend-->>Nginx: 200 OK Response (JSON / SSE Stream)
    Nginx-->>UI: Deliver Response to Frontend Component
